      "title": "Onderwijscoördinator Career Skills vakken",
      "description": "Onderwijscoördinator Career Skills vakken | Working at | Erasmus University Rotterdam Skip to main content Skip to search Skip to subnavigation Working at Erasmus University Rotterdam Close Open search Close Open menu Working at Erasmus University Rotterdam Switch language to EN English current language NL Nederlands Search Close Search Search Featured results Primary Why work at EUR Open submenu Why work at EUR Campus Diversity Societal involvement Sustainability Working conditions Working areas Open submenu Working areas Academic staff Working in Finance Working in IT Working at Legal Affairs Working at Real Estate & Facilities PhD LDE traineeship International staff Practical information Open submenu Practical information Candidate portal Vacancies Onderwijscoördinator Career Skills vakken Listen This vacancy is only available in Dutch. Use the button below to view it in Dutch. View vacancy in Dutch Open navigation for Onderwijscoördinator Career Skills vakken Close Compare 0 study programmes Close Compare 0 study programmes 0 of 3 study programmes selected. @title Duration: @duration Remove @title Compare study programmes Breadcrumb Working at Erasmus University Rotterdam Working at Erasmus University Rotterdam Vacancies Onderwijscoördinator Career Skills vakken Working at Erasmus University Rotterdam Directly to Information Directly to Why work at EUR Working areas International staff Practical information Vacancies Information ANBI Cookies Disclaimer Privacy statement Accessibility Our channels Facebook Instagram X (formerly twitter) Linkedin Youtube Making Minds Matter Watch the video Close Our website uses cookies Overview This website uses cookies and similar technologies (hereinafter collectively: 'cookies'). In this menu, you can choose which types of cookies and purposes you consent to. Functional: ​​These cookies are technically necessary for the website to function properly. Using the website is not possible without accepting thes